/S /P
/E (ECLA empowers Ethiopian immigrants and underserved communities in the Greater Los Angeles area by offering comprehensive immigration support and culturally sensitive programs that simplify the immigration process through accessible guidance and advocacy. By bridging resources and creating inclusive pathways to stability, we ensure that individuals can thrive socially, emotionally, and economically in a supportive environment. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
450 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In the current immigration environment, we are living through many policy upheavals that are greatly impacting our immigrant community. We work closely with other immigrant nonprofit allies, legal aid partners, and we make use of our trusted in-house pro bono, bilingual, immigration attorneys. We are filled with gratitude for all the support.)
/Pg 15 0 R
>>
endobj
